            <ArticleTitle>[Pathomorphological alterations in the hypothalamo-hypophyseal-adrenal system in bronchial asthma patients died in status asthmaticus].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Morphologic changes in the paraventricular nucleus (PVN) of the hypothalamus, in hypophyseal frontal lobe and adrenal cortex are adaptive and reactive changes. In status asthmaticus, there is a high hormonal activity manifesting morphologically with hypertrophic neurosecretory granules.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
